      "changes": "Preserved every selected root resource and mapped shared guardrails into the bundle. Retained Experimental maturity and Apache notices. Replaced a forced 3.14t baseline, universal tool installs and fixed QA gates with project-selected runtime, dependencies and evidence. Separated native declarations, actual GIL state, admitted concurrency and ABI support; made limited-API sibling guidance an optional immutable external source. Replaced the warning-only import gate with an explicit failed-import-aware runtime check. Corrected GIL/container and cache claims, PyDict_Next protection, atomic-storage guidance, native ownership/attachment and parallel-flake interpretation; qualified binding/backend examples and sanitizer coverage. Generated UI metadata through the original Skill Creator helper."
